# No keys are required for local development.
# Every data source used today (Planetary Computer STAC, Natural Earth, Nominatim,
# Photon, EOX and OpenFreeMap tiles) is public and keyless.
#
# Copy to .env and fill in locally if needed. Never commit .env.
# Hosting uses `wrangler login` (OAuth), so no Cloudflare keys are needed here.

# Optional: Planetary Computer subscription key for higher rate limits
# PC_SDK_SUBSCRIPTION_KEY=
